ng tape\": 33.66,\n  \"label printer\": 205.92,\n  \"safety goggles\": 58.56\n}\n```","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Now drop every line item whose unit price is below 79 and recompute the total due from the lines that remain. Reply with only a JSON object with keys \"line_items\" (array of the remaining descriptions, in the original order) and \"total\" (number, rounded to 2 decimal places).","role":"user"}]